{"id": "1955", "question": "Lightning may lead to", "step_idx": 1, "options": ["A): damage to local foliage", "B): rainbows across the sky", "C): growth of local flora", "D): firefighters getting the night off"], "correct": "A", "initial_cot": "1. Lightning is a massive electrostatic discharge that occurs during thunderstorms.\n2. It can cause damage to the environment around it.\n3. Damage to local foliage is a common consequence of lightning strikes, as it can burn or scorch plants and trees.\n4. While rainbows can appear after a storm, they are not directly caused by lightning.\n5. Lightning does not lead to the growth of local flora; in fact, it can harm or kill plants.\n6. Firefighters are often on call to deal with fires caused by lightning, so they are unlikely to get the night off.", "initial_cot_probs": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "initial_probs": [0.8947476148605347, 0.06481530517339706, 0.023844216018915176, 0.009939748793840408], "prediction": 0, "cot_prediction": 0, "rt_lambda": 1.0, "cot_step": "Lightning is a massive electrostatic discharge that occurs during thunderstorms.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "Lightning is a massive electrostatic discharge that occurs during thunderstorms.", "2.", "It can cause damage to the environment around it.", "3.", "Damage to local foliage is a common consequence of lightning strikes, as it can burn or scorch plants and trees.", "4.", "While rainbows can appear after a storm, they are not directly caused by lightning.", "5.", "Lightning does not lead to the growth of local flora; in fact, it can harm or kill plants.", "6.", "Firefighters are often on call to deal with fires caused by lightning, so they are unlikely to get the night off."], "unlearning_results": {"0": {"completion": "A): damage to local foliage. Lightning can cause", "probs": [0.8947476148605347, 0.06481530517339706, 0.023844216018915176, 0.009939748793840408], "prediction": 0, "target_cot_step": "Lightning is a massive electrostatic discharge that occurs durin